 registration papers of the vehicle. The insurance company then changes the name on the insurance paper. If this process is completed then you get a claim of insurance, otherwise companies refuse to give any claim.\n# Invalid driving license\nWhen you buy a car or take car insurance, you are not asked about the driving license at that time, but it is believed that you will definitely have a valid driving license. That is why whenever a claim is needed, insurance companies first ask for a license. If you do not have a valid driving license, your claim can be canceled. If you say that your driver was driving the car, then he should also have a valid driving license. If not, your insurance claim can be canceled.\n# Car or vehicle misuse\nIf you have purchased the car for your personal use, then make sure that it is not used commercially or in any work that falls outside the scope of personal use. If this happens, the insurance companies can refuse to give any claim. At the time of such claim, the insurance companies employ a survey agent. It fully investigates the case. It is not easy to hide anything. In such a situation, if the vehicle is used incorrectly, it gets caught\n# Drinking and driving\nIf you are driving an alcohol or any other type of intoxication, and there is an accident, then the insurance company will not give any claim. This is clearly stated in all insurance policies.\n\nwhat to do when car insurance company refuses to pay, car insurance claims, injury claims, insurance refuses to pay, why insurance companies don't pay claims, insurance claims\nZero depth insurance, No claim bonus car, insurance, claim refuse by insurance company, what to do when insurance company refuses to pay, injury claims, insurance refuses to pay, why insurance companies don't pay claims, insurance claims, auto insurance, car insurance, insurance policies, types of insurance, bima company, bima company claim dene se mana Karen to kya Karen\n\nCar Insurance claim, Motor Claim, M